# Booking rules

Full spec: `@docs/architecture.md` §6 (Scheduling) and §7.1 (booking flow).

Hard rules:

- Double-booking prevention is a **Postgres exclusion constraint**, not app logic.
  See the SQL in `docs/architecture.md` §6.
- A slot is only "taken" if a Booking with status PENDING/CONFIRMED/IN_PROGRESS
  overlaps. CANCELLED and NO_SHOW don't block.
- Price is snapshotted at booking time. Never recompute from current rates.
- Pickup postcode is geocoded at booking time and stored as lat/lng.
- Instructor accept window is 24h. Timeout → auto-cancel + release PI.
